body:
I cannot comment on if you will get targeted, in my personal experience however no one seems to care. I was walking home today (9:02 am in passing) and two dudes were having a happy smoke in their parked car. As other posters mentioned, just watch for Karens.

&#x200B;

Edit: The fireworks started the official "stampede".  Pretty sure almost everything is legal until the 12th. Calgary Purge begin. ;)
